0&s=10beb5973f8fc24ca782dd4e122488c1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！国王と王妃が休暇で不在の間、王座を支配している道化師です。彼女はテディベアと話し、王国の臣民の望みを聞く！(私のストリームのチャットはテディベアを通して話します）。\n\nクリーム色か白のテディベアを希望します。あとはあなた次第です！ありがとうございました<3\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1S8liy8mAysVNgkYpJIn1d6MORHFS22nq?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saharakon/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5d7027e4/uploads/origins/5ab62252-fa1a-44c3-97f1-304dbe018f38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce67d7c4537d1b0881f0cd9bb8950b72", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5d7027e4/uploads/origins/5ab62252-fa1a-44c3-97f1-304dbe018f38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce67d7c4537d1b0881f0cd9bb8950b72, https://si.imgix.net/5d7027e4/uploads/origins/5ab62252-fa1a-44c3-97f1-304dbe018f38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6961dce6194e388adac0b3f6d708882f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5d7027e4/uploads/origins/5ab62252-fa1a-44c3-97f1-304dbe018f38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a85e40596ca196024d1e89a61ac6ca40 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, さはらこん-sensei! Your art is very cute! I wanted multiple artworks of my mascot if possible please!\n\nMascot is named Mimi. Like ear ear.\nThey have 4 ears techincally.\nThey're a cat & rabbit sewing magical creature and stuffed animal!\nTheir rabbit ears also works as arms and paws.\nThe \"rabbit ears\" also stretch as long as possible.\nMimi can also be as big as they want to be. Super small or super big!\n\nThey have white and black \"fur\". blue and red eyes.\nUsually round. Mimi can change shape to be more rectangle and square to be funny.\nShe rolls around, hops, walks with her giant ear-paws, and wiggles.\n\nThey grant magical wishes and love to sell milkshakes and make ice cream!\n\nIn the reference, it's the small animal creature. Even though they keep the same emotionless expression, they do a lot of different actions that shows their emotions truthfully.\n\nThank you very much! I leave the fun poses to さはらこん-sensei!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1QPmXGE7ra05cd_edZFGasairHR81Tyhm/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saharakon/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/81fdd4bb/uploads/origins/198f92ae-1382-4636-963c-f813a6ca00bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=95d40261cf4686d013427da5959019e4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/81fdd4bb/uploads/origins/198f92ae-1382-4636-963c-f813a6ca00bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=95d40261cf4686d013427da5959019e4, https://si.imgix.net/81fdd4bb/uploads/origins/198f92ae-1382-4636-963c-f813a6ca00bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aa3e53c84e4f363619d4899b8cdedb25 2x, https://si.imgix.net/81fdd4bb/uploads/origins/198f92ae-1382-4636-963c-f813a6ca00bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5dd6c90006d128f78d008349ebb1ee3d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saharakon/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/71f2f76e/uploads/origins/911ce5b1-7015-48e8-97c0-4afc16d67ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8541a4d62fcd978327a5893be7b7abe0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/71f2f76e/uploads/origins/911ce5b1-7015-48e8-97c0-4afc16d67ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8541a4d62fcd978327a5893be7b7abe0, https://si.imgix.net/71f2f76e/uploads/origins/911ce5b1-7015-48e8-97c0-4afc16d67ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c1d44db509f8970a6be2261c2117cc1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/71f2f76e/uploads/origins/911ce5b1-7015-48e8-97c0-4afc16d67ddd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff339ffafdf710d00491e0f7b75dc8a2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your art is super cute~ \nI wanted to ask if you can come up with a mascot design based on my VTuber? I would like it to be based on a ghost~\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kT5aiBw7Y-VG91aJ5mAXLlYV8JDCWUmM?usp=sharing\n\nIt would be great if you can take some inspiration from 'Shinwoo x Finding Unicorn' figures\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1vfBnVJdR1hRh9PQouTXj09HS_CTvrlWv?usp=sharing\n\nFeel free to make it do any poses! Some examples are like it being spooked, angry, etc.\n\nPlease include a psd file~ Will be using it for png tuber for my stream~ \nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@saharakon/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c1838c5/uploads/origins/37155a4a-c9a9-4055-9a39-aec219106164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0c9122650934ee103f1afac3baae202", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4c1838c5/uploads/origins/37155a4a-c9a9-4055-9a39-aec219106164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0c9122650934ee103f1afac3baae202, https://si.imgix.net/4c1838c5/uploads/origins/37155a4a-c9a9-4055-9a39-aec219106164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3cfcb2bb94c6f52308638fe64078e50e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4c1838c5/uploads/origins/37155a4a-c9a9-4055-9a39-aec219106164?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46c8eb2ec5f2d9827b0774c4f54e2cec 3x